  "gaps": "Viewed from outside: the photo is taken standing under the canopy, so the render shows the whole frontage from above instead. Canopy is a plain flat slab on columns (no steel grid beams, no translucent panels), frontage has no entrance frame, signage panels or British Airways colour blocks (no logos by rule), no cart rows, bollards or footbridge arch. Tower is a simple cylinder without stay cables."
